  "checklist": [
    "I drop the English preposition with *écouter, regarder, attendre, chercher, payer*.",
    "I use *penser à, rêver de, faire confiance à, jouer à / de*.",
    "I know which verbs take *de* or *à* before an infinitive.",
    "I use *vouloir, pouvoir, aimer* + infinitive with no preposition."
  ],
